ssh.description:
Home Assistant can SSH to your OmniSwitches to read `show mac-learning` and `show arp`, so wired clients appear on the map. It uses key or certificate authentication; a `<key>-cert.pub` next to the key is picked up automatically.

{switches}

Pick each switch's **SSH address** from the addresses Cirrus knows for it; ones that answer from Home Assistant are listed first. You can also type any other IP or hostname, or choose “Don't read this switch”.

